{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/227029-synergy-rewrite-for-gmc","id":227029,"title":"Synergy Rewrite for GMC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-13T08:16:14-07:00","id":227029,"title":"Synergy Rewrite for GMC","content":"I'm working on a full rewrite of Geist for GMC since it won't be coming out in the foreseeable future. I started with updating Synergy to make it more in line with Integrity and Cover. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/itio1t466lirah5/Synergy_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Synergy Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> I'm also thinking about writing up a version where it's closer to the way they plan on doing Harmony in Idigam Chronicle. At the top of the meter is Life and at the bottom is Death, and since Sin-eaters are neither, going too far in one direction hurts them. I don't want to make it more like Werewolf, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T12:03:53-07:00","id":227213,"title":"","content":"I started, and got quite far, on a full GMC rewrite; including a totally different Synergy system. If you want to mine it for ideas just send me your email address.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm not too keen on eating Ghosts as a common synergy breaking point. I can see a lot of hungry Geists out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T12:46:31-07:00","id":227263,"title":"","content":"I'm also working on a <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/g777mige3tw1rpg/Geist_Update.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">full rewrite</a>. Trying to tie up a lot of the loose ends that Geist has. Someone told me they actually saw what I had on GitP or somewhere, but they couldn't drum up a link.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T13:06:32-07:00","id":227281,"title":"","content":"I have been poking around at doing this as well. <br /> <br /> First I'd like to give you props on presentation. The pdf looks real good.<br /> <br /> I had given thought to doing it more like Harmony as well but decided against it. I feel like Synergy is more about the way the Bound and the Geist work together than the balance of life and death. This version reflects that a lot better I think.<br /> <br /> The one thing about this version that I don't like is that you are using the life of the Geist before it died heavily even though you even mention that most Geists don't remember theirs lives. I would think that all of those places would be better served by being based on the Geist as it is.<br /> <br /> For example, a large difference between how I look at it and how you presented it is that you suggested that killing someone in the same way as the Geist died would be a breaking point, but Geist are embodiments of the death that created them, I would think that the breaking point should be to kill someone in any way OTHER than the way the Geist died.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T14:00:59-07:00","id":227326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/227029-synergy-rewrite-for-gmc?p=227281#post227281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First I'd like to give you props on presentation. The pdf looks real good.</div> </div> </div> </div>It always makes me feel good when people appreciate the PDFs. What do you think of the banner? I love making those. I've got a whole bunch of them for various supplements and game lines.<br /> <br /> As for the Breaking Points related to the Geist, sure, some of them are those weird type of ghosts that want you to perpetuate the same death that took them, but others might see you kill a woman in the same way they were murdered and it turns them off, souring their (well, <i>your</i> stomach). That's why it's only a suggested Breaking Point. Some Geists might have died in a specific way or with specific marks and they want you to murder other people in the same way. Maybe they had both their cheeks slashed, and their heart stabbed, so they go around and get their Sin-eater to Inigo Montoya the enemies of justice (or whatever). A mother who was killed by her husband on the other hand probably doesn't want you to go out and kill battered women. (That was actually my Reaper's concept; her Geist took her own life and her children's after her husband was cheating on her. She became a La Llarona and made the Sin-eater kill unfaithful and abusive husbands)<br /> <br /> Some might be okay with Sin-eaters perpetuating their death, and even encourage it, while others might not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T09:24:04-07:00","id":228060,"title":"","content":"The banner does look good. I don't have Geist on hand to compare it too but it seems pretty fitting.<br /> <br /> I think I was looking at it in a more high level way. Not so much the exact method of killing as the general Threshold related to the killing. But I can see your version working out very well too. Maybe just include both in the example Breaking Points, with a note that it depends on the Geist in question.<br /> <br /> Your personal example of the La Llarona actually fits really well with how I conceptualize it. While it's not exactly how she died it is related to how/why she died. It would make sense that killing any person other than an unfaithful or abusive husband would be a Breaking Point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T22:01:21-07:00","id":228775,"title":"","content":"I've actually added a new thing to my personal rewrite that should cover when the Sin-eater and Geist have a tiff.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Trinigan FG\">Interaction with the Geist</span></span><br /> The Bargain fuses Sin-eater and Geist together in unison, but they\u2019re still separate entities even if they possess the same space. Sometimes their goals and desires conflict, and they might struggle against each other. The Geist is for the most part a passenger, but even a back seat driver can make a grab for the wheel sometimes. A Sin-eater can allow their Geist to take control, if they choose, forgoing any contest. The Geist controls the physical body and the Sin-eater gains an additional Aspiration directed towards what the Geist wants to accomplish. Once they accomplish it, the Geist relinquishes control.<br /> Sometimes a Sin-eater doesn\u2019t want to give up their body, though. Either out of personal possession--it isher body, after all--and sometimes because the goal of the Geist conflicts with the Sin-eater\u2019s convictions or own goals. Geists can often be dangerous when left unchained. If a Sin-eater wants to struggle against the Geist, they perform a sort of Abjuration against themselves. The Sin-eater rolls Stamina + Composure to keep control, while the Storyteller rolls based on Psyche for the Geist. <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 100%\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Trinigan FG\">Psyche Rating</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Trinigan FG\">Dice to Struggle</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">1 to 3</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">4</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">4 to 5</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">5</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">6 to 8</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">7</span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">9 to 10</span></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">9</span></td> </tr> </table></div> A Sin-eater can spend a point of Willpower to resist the Geist, only instead of providing +3 on the roll, it staves the Geist off for another turn. During this turn, the Sin-eater physically strains, growling, exerting control over their body. The roll for the turn is held off. When a Sin-eater finally stops spending Willpower (either out of choice or because they simply can\u2019t) then the roll finally happens, and the Sin-eater gets +1 for each point of Willpower spent in this way.<br /> If the Sin-eater wins, the Geist is pushed back and calms down (metaphorically, at least. It won\u2019t attempt to take over for the rest of the scene, but it might still grumble and groan) as the Sin-eater retains control over their own body. If the Geist wins, they take control, as described above.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}